WEBVTT

00:15.590 --> 00:16.870
Sei! Now!

00:16.870 --> 00:17.900
Right!

00:27.970 --> 00:29.340
Did she get them?!

00:32.820 --> 00:34.650
We did it!

00:43.480 --> 00:46.920
Once again, we've safely cleared 
the area thanks to Sei.

00:46.920 --> 00:48.910
The monsters' numbers are really declining!

00:53.970 --> 00:55.900
Did you find something nice again?

00:56.790 --> 00:59.630
Oh, it's nothing important, but...

01:01.660 --> 01:03.040
The firs caught my eye.

01:03.400 --> 01:06.160
We also had them back home in my world.

01:06.660 --> 01:08.390
They bring back memories?

01:08.390 --> 01:10.860
Well, nothing special in particular.

01:10.860 --> 01:13.300
We just decorate them in wintertime.

01:13.870 --> 01:15.440
You decorate them?

01:15.440 --> 01:20.720
Yes, in celebration of a 
winter holiday, you could say.

01:20.720 --> 01:22.290
A holiday, huh?

01:22.290 --> 01:23.650
What do you celebrate?

01:23.650 --> 01:26.230
Lots of different things
like a holy birthday,

01:26.230 --> 01:28.960
the winter solstice, 
or the coming of a new year.

01:28.960 --> 01:30.110
I think...

01:30.110 --> 01:32.070
<i>There are theories on its origin.</i>

01:32.070 --> 01:34.040
You think?

01:34.040 --> 01:36.320
I don't know much about it.

01:36.320 --> 01:41.570
In my homeland, it's a romantic holiday 
that you spend with a loved one.

01:41.570 --> 01:42.750
<i>Supposedly.</i>

01:42.750 --> 01:44.680
You spend it with a loved one?

01:44.680 --> 01:47.120
Do you have any special memories of—

01:47.120 --> 01:48.320
Nope.

01:48.320 --> 01:50.090
That was a swift response.

01:50.090 --> 01:52.470
I was always working.

01:52.470 --> 01:57.050
<i>With the end-of-the-year rush, 
a corporate slave like me never had the time.</i>

01:57.050 --> 02:00.320
Did you dislike the holiday?

02:00.820 --> 02:01.770
No.

02:04.320 --> 02:06.440
I enjoyed the festive atmosphere.

02:09.120 --> 02:11.830
The illuminations at night were very pretty.

02:13.360 --> 02:15.740
There were all sorts of decorations.

02:15.740 --> 02:20.490
Ornaments that shine like the stars,
 strings of twinkling bulbs,

02:20.490 --> 02:23.210
and others that make the snow 
glitter from their reflection...

02:23.210 --> 02:25.960
They'd all light up the city at night.

02:26.310 --> 02:30.170
I'm sorry. I'm probably not doing
a very good job of conveying it.

02:30.170 --> 02:32.690
No, I can picture it clearly.

02:32.690 --> 02:34.280
Really?

02:34.280 --> 02:36.630
Yes. I think it's beautiful.

02:37.000 --> 02:39.040
Yes! It truly is!

02:39.040 --> 02:41.230
Everything just sparkles...

02:41.230 --> 02:42.650
That's not what I meant.

02:43.100 --> 02:47.060
I think you're stunning 
when you talk about things you like.

02:57.200 --> 02:58.760
<i>He has such a handsome face.</i>

02:58.760 --> 03:00.860
<i>Wait, hold on. No way. This is too much.</i>

03:00.860 --> 03:03.490
<i>Isn't the commander the stunning one here?</i>

04:34.000 --> 04:37.010
"Interlude"

04:41.710 --> 04:44.070
You look rather exhausted.

04:44.070 --> 04:46.680
Was the subjugation difficult?

04:47.420 --> 04:51.440
It went well enough. 
There were far fewer monsters this time.

04:51.440 --> 04:54.650
<i>I can't tell them I'm like this 
over the commander's smile...</i>

04:54.650 --> 04:58.100
The number of subjugations
 is also decreasing lately.

04:58.100 --> 05:00.890
It's been a bit quiet for 
the Royal Magi Assembly, too.

05:00.890 --> 05:04.180
My, things really are calming down.

05:04.180 --> 05:09.120
That means we'll be up against
a new problem soon.

05:09.120 --> 05:10.580
Another problem?

05:11.060 --> 05:13.730
To be frank, your engagement.

05:14.040 --> 05:15.990
Engagement?

05:15.990 --> 05:18.710
Why are you making such a 
disagreeable expression?

05:18.710 --> 05:20.690
No reason...

05:20.690 --> 05:24.180
It's time to think about marriage seriously.

05:24.180 --> 05:26.430
You've used your duties as an excuse thus far,

05:26.430 --> 05:28.800
<i>What the heck is this? 
Am I back at my parents' house?</i>

05:26.430 --> 05:28.810
but you cannot put it off forever.

05:28.800 --> 05:30.520
N-Now, now...

05:30.520 --> 05:36.210
Have you not already had your debut
and is your work not slowing down?

05:36.210 --> 05:37.450
Well, yes.

05:37.450 --> 05:39.120
That's true, Mother.

05:39.120 --> 05:40.830
Who are you calling your mother?

05:41.220 --> 05:46.310
Still, that being the case, aren't you
going to receive invitations more often?

05:46.310 --> 05:48.220
You mean to tea parties like this?

05:48.220 --> 05:51.450
Well, I'm sure you'll get invited 
to evening parties as well.

05:51.450 --> 05:52.000
Huh?

05:52.000 --> 05:54.350
You're most popular, Sei.

05:54.350 --> 05:55.430
That's not true...

05:55.430 --> 05:56.710
It is <i>quite</i> true.

05:57.290 --> 06:01.600
I'd wager the royal palace is simply 
flooded with invitations for you.

06:01.600 --> 06:02.450
What?

06:02.450 --> 06:04.430
I'm not good with that stuff...

06:09.640 --> 06:10.570
Sei.

06:10.570 --> 06:16.360
I know I've said my piece, but in the end,
 I want you to do as you wish.

06:19.280 --> 06:20.700
Even so, given your status,

06:20.700 --> 06:22.870
social events will be a part of your life.

06:22.870 --> 06:25.780
You must think of ways 
to graciously sidestep them.

06:30.140 --> 06:31.450
Yeah...

06:31.760 --> 06:33.590
I'll give it some thought.

06:40.800 --> 06:42.910
Oh, look at the time.

06:42.910 --> 06:46.050
Well, I have another engagement, 
so I'll excuse myself for today.

06:48.220 --> 06:50.430
See you again. Farewell.

06:53.140 --> 06:57.310
I said that... but what a conundrum.

06:58.020 --> 06:58.770
What is?

07:01.190 --> 07:02.940
I am talking about Sei.

07:02.940 --> 07:08.570
After her debut, many nobles
 have been testing the waters.

07:08.570 --> 07:11.210
Oh, you mean for a political marriage...

07:11.210 --> 07:16.910
I've been giving noncommittal responses,
 but I won't be able to do so forever.

07:16.910 --> 07:22.470
Well, I think Sei's feelings are most 
important in a situation like this.

07:23.050 --> 07:25.340
You're absolutely right...

07:27.260 --> 07:31.640
However, marriages between nobles 
are not necessarily matters of the heart.

07:32.220 --> 07:35.430
I'm not sure society will 
understand how she feels.

07:37.440 --> 07:41.650
Although, I'm sure the romance of it all
is normal in your world.

07:43.340 --> 07:45.110
I guess it is.

07:45.110 --> 07:49.160
I don't really get marrying for your family
 or because of your parents.

07:49.800 --> 07:55.450
But I definitely want to marry who I love...

07:57.080 --> 08:01.290
Oh! Not that I have 
anyone like that right now!

08:04.760 --> 08:10.930
How splendid it would be to marry someone 
who shares that feeling of love with you...

08:15.100 --> 08:16.850
What about you, Liz?

08:18.560 --> 08:21.020
Are you all right with the way things are?

08:23.480 --> 08:26.230
I've never even thought about that.

08:26.230 --> 08:30.100
This is what it means to be 
the daughter of a marquis.

08:33.910 --> 08:38.330
However, including my obligations as a lady,

08:38.330 --> 08:41.310
I have chosen to walk this path myself.

08:43.840 --> 08:47.960
Besides, don't you think building 
a loving relationship from scratch

08:47.960 --> 08:49.800
is also a splendid thing?

08:50.130 --> 08:50.930
Yeah...

08:53.020 --> 08:53.920
Yeah.

08:58.560 --> 09:01.690
I want you to find happiness, Liz.

09:02.390 --> 09:05.850
Aira, I wish the same for you.

09:11.130 --> 09:15.430
I hope for your happiness as well.

09:25.420 --> 09:28.780
The Minister of Military Affairs,
 Josef Hawke,

09:28.780 --> 09:30.880
will now report on the subjugations.

09:30.880 --> 09:31.950
Yes.

09:32.840 --> 09:34.110
A few days ago,

09:34.110 --> 09:37.810
the Third Order completed 
another subjugation with the Holy Saint.

09:38.330 --> 09:42.730
With this, all known miasma swamps
 have been eradicated.

09:43.080 --> 09:45.980
We are now scouting regions
that have not been inspected.

09:46.780 --> 09:48.690
Excellent work.

09:49.060 --> 09:50.800
Continue as you have.

09:50.800 --> 09:51.650
Yes, sire!

09:52.530 --> 09:56.120
And that concludes our agenda 
for today's cabinet meeting.

09:56.120 --> 09:57.500
Will that be all?

09:58.060 --> 10:00.490
Yes, let's adjourn.

10:05.050 --> 10:07.640
We're done sooner than I expected.

10:07.640 --> 10:10.040
Indeed, we're wrapping before noon.

10:10.040 --> 10:13.260
As all morning cabinet meetings should!

10:16.480 --> 10:19.510
Er, this is also thanks to the Holy Saint...

10:19.510 --> 10:23.760
I've received reports that the monster
population continues to decline.

10:23.760 --> 10:27.140
Yes, the end of this endeavor
 is finally in sight.

10:27.140 --> 10:30.940
Now, we must prepare for the future.

10:30.940 --> 10:32.650
By that, you mean...

10:33.560 --> 10:35.610
Lady Sei's future.

10:54.380 --> 10:58.640
Good afternoon, Lord Hawke. 
Has the meeting concluded?

10:58.960 --> 11:01.430
Good afternoon, Marquis Ashley.

11:01.760 --> 11:04.270
The meeting adjourned without issue.

11:04.270 --> 11:06.820
Are you meeting with His Majesty after this?

11:06.820 --> 11:09.760
Yes, I received a summons.

11:15.600 --> 11:19.450
I imagine it is in regard to 
the engagement of the Holy Saint.

11:19.450 --> 11:22.110
Was that not mentioned during the meeting?

11:22.110 --> 11:23.540
Yes, it was.

11:23.540 --> 11:26.520
What is your youngest brother going to do?

11:26.830 --> 11:28.330
What do you mean?

11:28.330 --> 11:33.050
Is your family going to nominate him 
as a suitor for the Holy Saint?

11:33.050 --> 11:35.310
I cannot say anything on the matter.

11:35.620 --> 11:37.800
If that's the case, perhaps the Drewes

11:37.800 --> 11:40.770
or the Valdecs will nominate a suitor.

11:42.220 --> 11:45.470
We have no real control over the situation.

11:45.470 --> 11:48.940
The final decision will lie 
with the Holy Saint herself.

11:49.250 --> 11:50.400
I see.

11:50.750 --> 11:55.590
Well, I must be off. My apologies 
for taking up your time.

11:55.590 --> 11:59.110
No, my apologies for keeping you 
from your appointment.

12:00.660 --> 12:04.620
Personally, I wouldn't mind
if it were Commander Hawke.

12:20.640 --> 12:21.600
A marriage interview?

12:21.600 --> 12:22.800
That's right.

12:23.450 --> 12:26.520
I was wondering why you 
gathered us all here.

12:27.250 --> 12:28.400
I'll pass.

12:28.400 --> 12:31.690
I as well. I don't intend to have 
others arrange things for me.

12:33.150 --> 12:34.540
Just listen.

12:35.070 --> 12:37.750
It's someone you should know.

12:38.240 --> 12:41.360
Lady Sei Takanashi. Aren't you both familiar?

12:41.360 --> 12:43.650
Of course we are.

12:43.650 --> 12:46.740
There's been talk of arranging
a marriage for Sei?

12:46.740 --> 12:49.950
Yes, it came up at today's cabinet meeting.

12:50.610 --> 12:52.520
The plan is only in its infancy.

12:52.520 --> 12:54.840
The royal palace merely mentioned it.

12:54.840 --> 12:56.170
I see...

12:56.800 --> 13:01.260
However, various families are
 already beginning to make a move.

13:02.970 --> 13:05.420
In order to keep them from getting ideas,

13:05.420 --> 13:08.250
I was thinking of nominating 
a suitor from our family.

13:11.130 --> 13:15.800
Luckily, we have two bachelors in the house.

13:15.800 --> 13:19.050
And both of you happen
 to know the bride-to-be.

13:19.600 --> 13:21.500
However, only one of you can do this.

13:21.500 --> 13:26.830
The other families will stop us 
from nominating you both.

13:28.540 --> 13:32.860
So, which one of you would like
to be put forward?

13:33.400 --> 13:35.130
I don't mind either way.

13:35.670 --> 13:38.480
I've worked with her on multiple occasions.

13:38.480 --> 13:40.290
She is diligent and well-educated.

13:40.290 --> 13:42.540
She is neither arrogant nor flirtatious.

13:43.150 --> 13:46.370
I wouldn't mind marrying someone like her.

13:49.160 --> 13:52.630
However, I'm aware
 that she and Albert are close.

13:52.630 --> 13:55.810
I believe he'd make a much 
better candidate from our family.

13:58.530 --> 13:59.900
I understand.

13:59.900 --> 14:03.490
Let me ask just to be sure. 
Are you all right with that, Albert?

14:11.260 --> 14:13.460
Yes. I'll gladly do it.

14:14.030 --> 14:18.340
According to what I've heard, 
Albert definitely has an advantage.

14:18.340 --> 14:21.870
Yet even so, we do not know how
this will transpire until it's set in stone.

14:22.600 --> 14:24.990
What do you think of Grand Magus Drewes?

14:24.990 --> 14:26.890
I heard he and the Saint—

14:26.890 --> 14:28.100
Impossible.

14:28.510 --> 14:31.310
That man has no interest in human beings.

14:32.660 --> 14:37.180
He's a magic maniac who'd exhaust even 
a Holy Saint's power just for the sake of it.

14:37.180 --> 14:40.480
He is an overbearing demon
 who has no regard for people.

14:40.480 --> 14:43.180
He cannot hold a conversation
 if it doesn't concern magic.

14:43.180 --> 14:45.570
No, it's difficult to say even 
talking to him about that

14:45.570 --> 14:46.860
constitutes a conversation.

14:46.860 --> 14:50.040
He gets to speaking at incredible speed
when it comes to discourse on spellcraft.

14:50.040 --> 14:52.500
You're also talking quite fast, Brother...

14:53.280 --> 14:57.910
Okay, I understand that you respect 
the Grand Magus very much...

14:58.910 --> 15:01.510
Don't make such an unhappy face.

15:01.510 --> 15:07.130
Is it safe to say Grand Magus Drewes is only 
interested in the Holy Saint's magic?

15:07.130 --> 15:10.870
I would say so.
At least, as far as I can tell.

15:11.380 --> 15:13.480
And do you agree, Albert?

15:13.480 --> 15:16.690
I do... believe so.

15:16.690 --> 15:18.140
I see.

15:18.140 --> 15:21.120
Still, we don't know what 
the Drewes family is thinking.

15:21.120 --> 15:23.070
Considering his position...

15:33.250 --> 15:34.590
Brother?

15:34.910 --> 15:37.280
Going out at this hour?

15:38.040 --> 15:39.020
Well, yes.

15:39.020 --> 15:42.360
A subordinate of mine is still 
working at the facility.

15:42.360 --> 15:43.900
A subordinate, hmm?

15:43.900 --> 15:45.880
Are you talking about the Holy Saint?

15:45.880 --> 15:47.970
You certainly look after her.

15:47.970 --> 15:49.520
In part...

15:49.520 --> 15:52.220
She holds a very special position, after all.

15:52.220 --> 15:53.300
She does indeed.

15:53.300 --> 15:57.890
And it's only going to grow 
to be more special.

15:58.640 --> 16:02.650
There's murmuring about finding
 someone to marry the Holy Saint.

16:03.630 --> 16:05.600
Talk of marriage, huh?

16:05.600 --> 16:09.630
Yes. Various families are moving 
to nominate a suitor.

16:09.630 --> 16:12.130
Our most promising option is you, Johan.

16:12.130 --> 16:15.800
And what exactly are you planning
to do about that?

16:15.800 --> 16:18.840
Naturally, we'll submit 
your background information

16:18.840 --> 16:22.010
and portrait to the royal palace.

16:22.010 --> 16:25.860
Though, in your case, 
a portrait may not be necessary.

16:25.860 --> 16:29.210
I refuse. Please retract me as a suitor.

16:29.210 --> 16:33.660
How cold after I've done so much to help you.

16:33.660 --> 16:35.950
Don't you intend to pay your brother back?

16:35.950 --> 16:38.200
That's an entirely separate matter.

16:38.200 --> 16:39.920
Not necessarily.

16:39.920 --> 16:44.920
Putting me at ease by finally settling down
 is a great way to repay me.

16:44.920 --> 16:47.110
You're past the age where 
playing around is acceptable.

16:47.110 --> 16:49.660
I can't really argue with that.

16:49.660 --> 16:50.570
Right?

16:50.950 --> 16:54.530
So I'd like to suggest you take
 the Holy Saint for a wife.

16:56.050 --> 16:58.500
Do you want to cross the Hawke family?

16:59.120 --> 17:00.960
I don't.

17:00.960 --> 17:03.360
Then please give this up.

17:03.360 --> 17:06.700
I also don't want to get in the way
 of a friend's romance.

17:06.700 --> 17:10.770
I see. I thought it was a good opportunity.

17:18.590 --> 17:21.290
Take me to the Medicinal 
Flora Research Institute.

17:33.680 --> 17:35.430
Marriage, huh?

17:36.980 --> 17:43.170
<i>When I first met her, I felt like a problem
 child had been dropped into my lap.</i>

17:43.530 --> 17:46.110
<i>It was one thing after another...</i>

17:46.500 --> 17:50.460
<i>You take your eyes off her for a second
and something else crops up.</i>

17:50.840 --> 17:54.760
<i>So before I knew it, 
she was always on my mind...</i>

17:55.650 --> 17:58.760
<i>That's all it is.</i>

18:09.580 --> 18:13.260
I've never really thought about marriage.

18:14.080 --> 18:16.500
I guess I have to consider this seriously...

18:16.500 --> 18:18.880
You're still here?

18:19.400 --> 18:20.790
Director.

18:30.640 --> 18:33.340
I keep mulling over some things.

18:34.590 --> 18:36.050
Like getting engaged?

18:36.050 --> 18:38.260
How did you know?!

18:38.260 --> 18:41.220
It's become a hot topic in the royal palace.

18:41.670 --> 18:45.520
People are thinking of the Holy Saint's
future once she's completed her mission.

18:45.520 --> 18:47.810
I knew it...

18:49.590 --> 18:52.690
You still don't want to get married?

18:54.880 --> 18:57.410
It's not that I'm <i>not</i> interested at all.

18:57.410 --> 19:00.030
I've just never given it much thought.

19:00.030 --> 19:03.560
I'm really happy with my life right now.

19:03.560 --> 19:07.340
Work is rewarding, I get to enjoy my hobbies,

19:07.340 --> 19:09.810
and I'm surrounded by kind people...

19:11.640 --> 19:18.460
So the idea of getting engaged 
and married makes me nervous.

19:19.030 --> 19:22.880
So you don't want the way 
things are now to change?

19:23.330 --> 19:26.060
Yeah... I guess that's it.

19:26.730 --> 19:28.520
I'm really not sure, though.

19:32.100 --> 19:34.920
Then do you want to marry me?

19:35.650 --> 19:36.530
Huh?

19:39.940 --> 19:41.950
What are you saying?

19:41.950 --> 19:43.560
I'm just kidding.

19:43.870 --> 19:48.580
Well, a fake engagement isn't a bad idea.

19:48.580 --> 19:52.820
You could keep living as you are
and spare yourself the trouble of suitors.

19:52.820 --> 19:56.100
My family would stop 
giving me a hard time too.

19:56.100 --> 19:58.740
I just came from a nagging myself.

19:59.430 --> 20:00.760
Oh.

20:00.760 --> 20:02.890
That kind of joke isn't funny.

20:02.890 --> 20:05.200
It's sexual harassment. I'll sue you.

20:05.200 --> 20:06.940
Sorry, sorry,

20:06.940 --> 20:09.300
I just can't help teasing you.

20:09.300 --> 20:12.610
You, who only ever thinks 
about work and medicinal plants,

20:12.610 --> 20:15.410
is considering getting married.

20:15.410 --> 20:18.740
I'm getting a little choked up.

20:18.740 --> 20:22.630
Director, sometimes you sound 
like you're my dad or something.

20:22.630 --> 20:25.540
At least think of me as an older brother...

20:27.160 --> 20:33.130
Well, I've said what I needed to
as your guardian in this world.

20:33.130 --> 20:35.650
Mull it over to your heart's content.

20:35.650 --> 20:38.170
Your feelings are what matter most here.

20:38.810 --> 20:40.030
Director...

20:42.240 --> 20:43.790
Thank you so much.

20:47.490 --> 20:48.770
One last thing...

20:49.300 --> 20:51.980
His feelings are important too.

20:55.440 --> 20:57.320
His feelings...?

21:27.970 --> 21:31.200
A miasma swamp was 
discovered in the Hawke Domain.

21:31.200 --> 21:35.690
Margrave Hawke has requested
 that knights be dispatched.

21:35.690 --> 21:38.150
Good work. You're dismissed.

21:38.150 --> 21:39.110
Yes!

21:42.360 --> 21:44.860
Your Majesty, what shall we do?

21:55.480 --> 21:58.500
At least during my reign,

21:58.980 --> 22:04.060
this may be Lady Sei's last mission 
as the Holy Saint...

23:35.020 --> 23:40.020
Next Time

23:35.020 --> 23:40.020
"The Frontier"
